<div><section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow pale">MONETISE YOUR SPACE</span><h1>Spaces can have<br><em>stories to tell.</em></h1><p>A wall, screen, table or building could become a meaningful media opportunity.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><div class="advisor-card">@if($submitted)<div class="success-box"><h2>Space submitted for assessment.</h2><p>We will review feasibility, ownership rights and commercial requirements before considering any listing.</p></div>@else<div class="form-header"><h2>Show us your media opportunity.</h2><p>Tell us about the physical or digital space you manage. No advertising rights are granted through this form.</p></div><form wire:submit="submit"><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name<input wire:model="name" required>@error('name')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror</label><label>Contact email<input wire:model="email" type="email" required>@error('email')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror</label><label>Phone<input wire:model="phone"></label><label>Company or property<input wire:model="company"></label><label>Asset type<select wire:model="asset_type" required><option value="">Choose type</option><option>Billboard / Wall</option><option>Digital Screen</option><option>Restaurant / Table</option><option>Retail / Mall</option><option>Elevator / Building</option><option>Vehicle / Transit</option><option>Other</option></select>@error('asset_type')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror</label><label>Location<input wire:model="location" placeholder="City, state or address" required>@error('location')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror</label></div><label>Describe the space<textarea wire:model="description" rows="5" required placeholder="Approximate size, estimated footfall, ownership, current use and access restrictions..."></textarea>@error('description')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror</label><label>Optional photo of the space (max 5MB)<input type="file" wire:model="photo" accept="image/*">@error('photo')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror</label><div class="hidden-honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><input wire:model="website" tabindex="-1"></div><label class="checkline"><input wire:model="consent" type="checkbox">I consent to follow-up about feasibility and potential partnership.</label>@error('consent')<small class="error">{{$message}}</small>@enderror<br><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Submit My Space ↗</button></form>@endif</div></div></section></div>
